invariant: INV-41
file: rsa_mont.c
catches: rsa_avx2_model_test
reason: rsa_mont.c's use_avx2 answers 1 whatever the session's ch_cfg.cpu
  says, so a session on a CPU without AVX2 runs the kernel's instructions
  and dies. bin/rsa_avx2_model_test counts the calls rsa_vp1_cpu makes
  into rsa_avx2_public over the lane model under CH_CPU_PROBED alone and
  requires none.

--- old
    return (cpu & CH_CPU_AVX2) != 0;
--- new
    (void)cpu;
    return 1;
